/* 寫作 */
WT("t01","w1","很多年輕人喜歡在網路上分享自己的生活。他們會上傳照片、影片，並和朋友互相留言。然而，在網路上透露太多個人資料可能會帶來危險。因此，我們在分享之前應該三思。",
  "Many young people like to share their lives online. They upload photos and videos and leave comments for each other. However, giving out too much personal information online can be dangerous. Therefore, we should think twice before sharing anything.",
  "重點：share... online、upload、leave comments、動名詞主詞 giving out... can be...、think twice（三思）。"),
WC("c01","w2","現在很多家庭都有掃地機器人、智慧音箱等科技產品。請寫一篇短文：(1) 舉例說明科技如何讓家庭生活更方便；(2) 你認為科技是否也帶來了壞處？請說明。",
  "Technology has made home life much more convenient. In my home, we have a robot vacuum that cleans the floor every day while my parents are at work. We also have a smart speaker. We can ask it about the weather, play music, or turn on the lights just by talking. My grandmother especially loves it because she doesn't need to read small buttons.\n\nHowever, technology also brings some problems. Since the machines do the housework, I help less at home than before, and I sometimes forget how to do simple chores myself. In addition, my family spends a lot of time looking at screens, so we talk to each other less during dinner. I think we should enjoy the convenience of technology but also make time to do things together.",
  "兩段：好處（兩個例子）→ 壞處（兩點）→ 結論平衡兩者。"),

/* 口說 */
GI1("ra01","s1",[
  "Welcome to Green Hill Library. Our opening hours are 8:30 a.m. to 9:00 p.m., Tuesday through Sunday. We are closed on Mondays. Members can borrow up to ten books for three weeks. Our study rooms on the fourth floor can be reserved online for two hours at a time. Please keep your voice down and do not eat in the reading areas.",
  "Last year, I started a small vegetable garden on our apartment balcony. I planted tomatoes, green onions, and basil in old plastic boxes. At first, many of the plants died because I gave them too much water. But I learned from my mistakes, and by summer, we had fresh tomatoes for our salads. Growing my own food has made me appreciate farmers much more."
]),
GI2("qa01","s2","What did you do last night?","Last night I reviewed my English notes and then watched a TV show with my family before going to bed."),
GI2("qa02","s2","What is your favorite sport to watch?","My favorite sport to watch is baseball. I often watch the games on TV with my father."),
GI2("qa03","s2","How often do you eat out?","I eat out about twice a week, usually on weekends with my family or friends."),
GI2("qa04","s2","What is the weather usually like in your hometown?","My hometown is in the south, so it's usually hot and sunny, even in winter."),
GI2("qa05","s2","What do you want to do this weekend?","This weekend, I want to sleep late on Saturday and go to the movies with my friends on Sunday."),
GI2("qb01","s3","What would you do if you missed the last train home?","If I missed the last train, I would first call my parents to let them know. Then I would check if there were any buses or a shared taxi going my way. If not, I might stay at a friend's place nearby or a cheap hotel, and go home the next morning.","",30),
GI2("qb02","s3","Do you prefer reading paper books or e-books? Why?","I prefer paper books. I like the feeling of turning pages, and reading on paper doesn't hurt my eyes like screens do. I can also write notes in the margins. However, e-books are convenient when I travel, because I can carry many books on one small device.","",30),
GI2("qb03","s3","Why do some people say teenagers should learn to cook?","People say teenagers should learn to cook because it's an important life skill. When they live alone in the future, they can make healthy meals instead of eating fast food. Cooking can also save money. Besides, cooking for family is a nice way to show love and share time together.","",30),
GI2("qb04","s3","Tell me about a gift that was important to you.","When I was twelve, my grandfather gave me an old watch that he had worn for forty years. He told me it reminded him to use his time wisely. I wear it on important days, like exams. It's important to me because it makes me feel that he is always with me.","",30),
GI2("qb05","s3","What do you think are the most important qualities of a good friend?","I think a good friend should be honest and trustworthy. They tell you the truth even when it's hard to hear, and they keep your secrets. A good friend also supports you when you're having a difficult time. Finally, it's important to be able to laugh together.","",30),
GI3("pd01","s4",["Where are these people?","What are they doing?","How do you think the people feel? Why?","If you still have time, please describe the picture in as much detail as possible."],
  "These people are in a big kitchen, probably at a community center or a cooking class. A teacher in a white hat is showing a group of students how to make dumplings. The students are standing around a long table, and each of them is folding dumplings. An old woman is helping a young boy, and a girl is laughing because her dumpling looks funny. I think everyone feels relaxed and happy, because they are smiling and working together. On the table there are bowls of filling, flour, and plates of finished dumplings.",
  "推測地點（probably at...）、描述多人動作；感受要附理由。",
  "A cooking class in a big kitchen. A teacher in a chef hat shows a group of people how to fold dumplings at a long table. People of different ages stand around the table folding dumplings. An old woman helps a young boy. A girl laughs at her oddly shaped dumpling. Bowls of filling, flour, and plates of finished dumplings on the table.")
